  Ekamantaṃ nisinnassa kho yasassa kulaputtassa bhagavā ānupubbī-
  kathaṃ4 kathesi, seyyathīdaṃ dānakathaṃ sīlakathaṃ saggakathaṃ kāmānaṃ
  ādīnavaṃ okāraṃ saṅkilesaṃ nekkhamme ānisaṃsaṃ pakāsesi. Yadā bhagavā
