  bhagavā ānupubbīkathaṃ kathesi, ---pe--- aparappaccayo satthusāsane
  bhagavantaṃ etadavoca: “Abhikkantaṃ bhante, abhikkantaṃ bhante.
  Seyyathāpi bhante, nikkujjitaṃ4. vā ukkujjeyya, paṭicchannaṃ vā
