Atha kho moggallānassa paribbājakassa imaṃ dhammapariyāyaṃ sutvā virajaṃ
vītamalaṃ dhammacakkhuṃ udapādi: “Yaṃ kiñci samudaya- dhammaṃ sabbaṃ taṃ
nirodhadhamman ”ti.

“Eseva dhammo yadi tāvadeva paccabyathā padamasokaṃ, adiṭṭhaṃ abbhatītaṃ
bahukehi kappanahutehī ”ti.

