  āgantukehi bhikkhūhi paṭisammodituṃ.

+ Atha kho bhagavā āyasmantaṃ upasenaṃ vaṅgantaputtaṃ etadavoca: “Kacci
  bhikkhū khamanīyaṃ? Kacci yāpanīyaṃ? Kaccittha2 appakilamathena
  addhānaṃ āgatā ”ti?3 “Khamanīyaṃ bhagavā. Yāpanīyaṃ bhagavā.
  Appakilamathena ca mayaṃ bhante addhānaṃ āgatā ”ti.

+ Jānantāpi tathāgatā pucchanti. Jānantāpi na pucchanti. Kālaṃ viditvā
