  bhavissati pivissatha. Sace bhattaṃ bhavissati bhuñjissatha. Sace
  khādanīyaṃ bhavissati khādissatha. No ce bhavissati yāgu vā2 bhattaṃ
  vā khādanīyaṃ vā piṇḍāya caritvā bhuñjissathā ”ti.
]

