  paṭikkamati, tattha āvaraṇaṃ kātun ”ti.

+ Tena kho pana samayena bhikkhū sāmaṇerānaṃ mukhadvārikaṃ āhāraṃ
  āvaraṇaṃ karonti. Manussā yāgupānampi saṅghabhattampi karontā sāmaṇere
