  āvaraṇaṃ katan ”ti. Manussā ujjhāyanti khīyanti vipācenti: “Kathaṃ hi
  nāma bhadantā sāmaṇerānaṃ mukhadvārikaṃ āhāraṃ āvaraṇaṃ karissantī
  ”ti? Bhagavato etamatthaṃ ārocesuṃ. “Na bhikkhave, mukhadvāriko āhāro
  āvaraṇaṃ kātabbo. Yo kareyya, āpatti dukkaṭassā ”ti.
