  karaṇīyo. Atirekalābho - saṅghabhattaṃ, uddesabhattaṃ, nimantanaṃ,
  salākabhattaṃ, pakkhikaṃ, uposathikaṃ, pāṭipadikaṃ. (1)

+ Paṃsukūlacīvaraṃ nissāya pabbajjā. Tattha te yāvajīvaṃ ussāho
