Vinayapiṭake Mahāvaggapāḷi 1 Uposathakkhandhakaṃ

Tehi bhikkhave, bhikkhūhi eko bhikkhu sāmantā āvāsā sajjukaṃ pāhetabbo:
‘Gacchāvuso saṅkhittena vā vitthārena vā pātimokkhaṃ pariyāpuṇitvā 1
āgacchā '”ti.

#block[
