  kho bhikkhūnaṃ etadahosi: “Kena nu kho uposathāgāraṃ sammajjitabban
  ”ti? Bhagavato etamatthaṃ ārocesuṃ. “Anujānāmi bhikkhave, therena
  bhikkhunā navaṃ bhikkhuṃ āṇāpetun ”ti. Therena āṇattā navā bhikkhū na
