  āpattiṃ āpanno hoti. Tehi bhikkhave, bhikkhūhi eko bhikkhu sāmantā
  āvāsā sajjukaṃ pāhetabbo: ‘Gacchāvuso taṃ āpattiṃ paṭikaritvā āgaccha.
