  “Anujānāmi bhikkhave, sattannaṃ sattāhakaraṇīyena pahite gantuṃ, na
  tveva appahite bhikkhussa bhikkhuniyā sikkhamānāya sāmaṇerassa
  sāmaṇeriyā upāsakassa upāsikāya. Anujānāmi bhikkhave, imesaṃ sattannaṃ
  sattāhakaraṇīyena pahite gantuṃ, na tveva appahite. Sattāhaṃ
  sannivatto kātabbo.

