#block[
#set enum(numbering: "1.", start: 111)
+ “Evaṃ bhante ”ti kho āyasmā soṇo āyasmato mahā kaccāyanassa paṭissutvā
  uṭṭhāyasanā āyasmantaṃ mahākaccāyanaṃ abhivādetvā padakkhiṇaṃ katvā
