  vandati. Evañca vadeti:

+ Avantidakkhiṇāpatho bhante, appabhikkhuko. Tiṇṇaṃ me vassānaṃ accayena
  kicchena kasirena tato tato dasavaggaṃ bhikkhusaṅghaṃ sannipātāpetvā
  upasampadaṃ alatthaṃ. Appeva nāma bhagavā avantidakkhiṇāpathe
  appatarena gaṇena upasampadaṃ anujāneyya.

